=== Root cause confirmed ===
The breaker's own comment said "the next attempt falls through to safe
generic conversation" — this session start (1fb2773f) IS that fallthrough,
and the "generic conversation" it fell through to spoke one very long,
unbroken turn with no natural end and no completion signal reachable
(the guided-topic system instruction, which alone makes
end_guided_topic_teaching relevant, was never injected for this session).

